  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Blue Raman Submarine Cable System [Investment Grant - Africa]</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action contributes to the general objectives of the Instrument as set out in Article 3(1) of the NDICI-GE Regulation and to the following specific objectives of the Action, namely to provide ultra-high speed diversified data connectivity on the Blue Raman cable to connect the European National Research and Education Networks (G&#xc9;ANT) to its counterparts in India, South and East Africa and potentially in Middle East, and among them directly without passing through the G&#xc9;ANT network in Europe. The investment will ensure seamless communication among education and public research institutions in those regions and with the EU research and education network (REN), enhancing global collaboration and innovation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This Planned Contract is linked to PC-67840, financed through the Asia BL - Asia Pacific Investment Facility (APIF) - Entity Id ACT-61003&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
